title: MySQL INTO OUTFILE Web Shell Write
id: c474d3bf-b605-4e3d-b46f-6e7830a047d1
status: experimental
description: Detects MySQL SELECT ... INTO OUTFILE/DUMPFILE writing to a web-accessible directory, a technique to drop a web shell or arbitrary file to the filesystem via SQL injection.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1505/003/
logsource:
  category: application
  product: mysql
detection:
  selection:
    query_text|contains:
      - 'INTO OUTFILE'
      - 'INTO DUMPFILE'
    query_text|contains:
      - '/www/'
      - '/htdocs/'
      - '.php'
      - '.jsp'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - query_text
  - user_name
  - client_ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate data export
level: high
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1505.003
